{"4947630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "7 Shifts in Subway", "steam_appid": 4947630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7 Shifts in Subway, you take on the role of a night-time train operator during what seems like an ordinary shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to drive the train through the subway at night, stop at stations, let passengers on and off, and watch what’s happening inside the cars through surveillance cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every passenger is human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some look almost normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others seem strange from the very first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/4422d3e5154694c55e28330b707b4e78.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/4422d3e5154694c55e28330b707b4e78.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/4422d3e5154694c55e28330b707b4e78.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch the passengers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the platforms and train cars through the cameras. Remember who boarded the train and which car the strange passengers are in. Pay attention to how their behaviour changes while you’re on the move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/00b6df08b03203a07fab4b5121d93db2.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/00b6df08b03203a07fab4b5121d93db2.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/00b6df08b03203a07fab4b5121d93db2.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the rules.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are rules on the subway, and you must follow them. They’re not just safety guidelines. They’re your only way to survive the night shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each passenger requires specific action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One passenger is afraid of the dark; another is afraid of the light. One person needs to be woken up with the buzzer; with another, you must not make any noise in the car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/88b9e43290d00c0487e00fe21befe767.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/88b9e43290d00c0487e00fe21befe767.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/88b9e43290d00c0487e00fe21befe767.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate the train:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This involves opening and closing the car doors, controlling the lighting, using the in-car buzzer and the train horn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the right action will allow you to continue your route. The wrong decision may end your shift early.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/8bac563c665979c873ecbb27ac699f76.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/8bac563c665979c873ecbb27ac699f76.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/8bac563c665979c873ecbb27ac699f76.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive seven shifts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new shift, the tension rises. There are more dangerous passengers and more rules associated with them. Things also start happening in stations, on trains and in tunnels that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival here is not about running or fighting. It depends entirely on your attentiveness, memory and ability to notice details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop is a test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every passenger can be a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7 Shifts in the Subway, fear arises not only from what you see, but also from what you might have missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't break the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make it to the final station alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seven night shifts with escalating tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surveillance of stations and cars through cameras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ordinary and dangerous passengers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique rules for different threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Control of doors, lighting and sound signals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random scary events along the route</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survival based on attentiveness and memory.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7 Shifts in Subway, you take on the role of a night-time train operator during what seems like an ordinary shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to drive the train through the subway at night, stop at stations, let passengers on and off, and watch what’s happening inside the cars through surveillance cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not every passenger is human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some look almost normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others seem strange from the very first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/4422d3e5154694c55e28330b707b4e78.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/4422d3e5154694c55e28330b707b4e78.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/4422d3e5154694c55e28330b707b4e78.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch the passengers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the platforms and train cars through the cameras. Remember who boarded the train and which car the strange passengers are in. Pay attention to how their behaviour changes while you’re on the move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/00b6df08b03203a07fab4b5121d93db2.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/00b6df08b03203a07fab4b5121d93db2.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/00b6df08b03203a07fab4b5121d93db2.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the rules.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are rules on the subway, and you must follow them. They’re not just safety guidelines. They’re your only way to survive the night shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each passenger requires specific action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One passenger is afraid of the dark; another is afraid of the light. One person needs to be woken up with the buzzer; with another, you must not make any noise in the car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/88b9e43290d00c0487e00fe21befe767.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/88b9e43290d00c0487e00fe21befe767.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/88b9e43290d00c0487e00fe21befe767.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operate the train:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This involves opening and closing the car doors, controlling the lighting, using the in-car buzzer and the train horn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking the right action will allow you to continue your route. The wrong decision may end your shift early.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/8bac563c665979c873ecbb27ac699f76.poster.avif?t=1788255758\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/8bac563c665979c873ecbb27ac699f76.webm?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/extras/8bac563c665979c873ecbb27ac699f76.mp4?t=1788255758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive seven shifts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new shift, the tension rises. There are more dangerous passengers and more rules associated with them. Things also start happening in stations, on trains and in tunnels that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival here is not about running or fighting. It depends entirely on your attentiveness, memory and ability to notice details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stop is a test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every passenger can be a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rule matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 7 Shifts in the Subway, fear arises not only from what you see, but also from what you might have missed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't break the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make it to the final station alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seven night shifts with escalating tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surveillance of stations and cars through cameras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ordinary and dangerous passengers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique rules for different threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Control of doors, lighting and sound signals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random scary events along the route</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survival based on attentiveness and memory.</p>", "short_description": "7 Shifts in Subway is a first-person psychological horror game in which you play as a night-train operator. Keep an eye on passengers through cameras, follow strange subway rules, and try to survive seven shifts where every mistake could be your last.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/36ee25920d6f7c1a37d390266de6add7aa90a614/header.jpg?t=1788255758", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/079f92f874513d8f932d8ee259e6eca3fad6e86f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788255758", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4947630/079f92f874513d8f932d8ee259e6eca3fad6e86f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788255758", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Athlon 3000G or Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 2GB or AMD Radeon R7 360<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12